response:
The incident involves a malicious Word document named "зміни оплата праці з нарахуваннями.docx" distributed via email to Ukrainian government organizations. The document exploits vulnerabilities CVE-2021-40444 and CVE-2022-30190 to run a PowerShell command that downloads and executes ms-msdt.exe from the malicious domain nod-update[.]it, ultimately infecting the victim system with Cobalt Strike Beacon.

